  "term": "developmental milestone",
  "definition": "A developmental milestone is a physical or behavioral sign that a child has reached a typical stage of growth or learned a skill expected by a certain age. These age-linked markers help show how a child is developing, and not reaching one on time can suggest developmental delay.",
